1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,520
(Sheldon:)Good golly, it's as if
it's actually happening to me.

2
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:07,120
(Priya(at door):)Raj finally went to bed.

3
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:12,530
(Leonard:)Sheldon's still up.

4
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:14,300
(Priya:)You said he goes
to bed at 9:00.

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,000
(Leonard:)Yeah, he does, but he got caught
up in a computer game and...

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:25,780
Hit troll with axe!

7
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:28,180
(Sheldon:)My, this is one tough troll.

8
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,850
(Priya:)Can't you get rid of him?

9
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:32,650
(Leonard:)If the past is any
indication, no.

10
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:34,820
(Sheldon:)Leonard, I'm trapped
in quicksand!

11
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:37,650
The axe is dragging me down!

12
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:38,750
Drop axe!

13
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:41,290
Drop axe, brilliant!

14
00:00:42,230 --> 00:00:45,630
(Leonard:)Give me a minute.

15
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,080
(Priya:)Sheldon.

16
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:49,130
(Sheldon:)Hold on.

17
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:50,130
Trying to figure out

18
00:00:50,130 --> 00:00:51,130
(Sheldon:)how to get the bucket,

19
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:53,600
(Sheldon:)so I can carry the mud
past the dragon.

20
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,940
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you need to
work in the morning.

21
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:56,940
I know!

22
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:57,940
Well, then bed, mister!

23
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:00,280
Five more minutes!

